\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Model architecture for our disruption labeling Convolutional Neural Network. We have four convolutional layers and two fully connected layers, and utilize max pooling, batch normalization, and dropout, along with a ReLU activation function. The model input is normalized current sampled at $\qty {4}{\kilo \hertz }$ and the output is disruption probability for the shot. }}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
